### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  API GATEWAY — All Routes via Single Entry Point
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080
@aliceToken = <PASTE_ALICE_JWT_HERE>

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.1 Register via Gateway
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Gateway Test User",
  "phone": "9988776655",
  "pin": "4321"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.2 Login via Gateway
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9988776655",
  "pin": "4321"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.3 Get Profile via Gateway (routed to user-service)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.4 Get Balance via Gateway (routed to wallet-service)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/wallet/balance/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.5 Add Money via Gateway
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/wallet/add-money/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000,
  "note": "Via Gateway"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.6 Make Payment via Gateway
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/transactions/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440001",
  "toUpiId": "bob@miniupi",
  "amount": 100,
  "note": "Payment via Gateway"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.7 Get Transaction History via Gateway
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/transactions/history/alice@miniupi?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.8 Try Accessing Internal Endpoint via Gateway (should be BLOCKED)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/wallet/internal/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "fromUpiId": "alice@miniupi",
  "toUpiId": "bob@miniupi",
  "amount": 100
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4.9 Gateway Health Check
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/actuator/health
